A special '''unarmed base attack bonus''' ('''UBAB''') replaces the normal [[BAB]] for [[monk]]s (and only monks) who fight unarmed or with a [[kama]] (if also not wearing [[armor]] nor using a [[shield]]).
This progression gives extra attacks at -3 off the previous attack, rather than the normal -5, with up to six attacks per [[round]] possible from this progression. (While the pattern indicates a seventh attack should be possible, the game does not allow it.)
As with the regular BAB, this special UBAB is based upon the base attack achieved at level 20 for [[epic character]]s.

There is no level requirement; merely having a single monk level gives a character access to this progression.
